        E_{95,20} = \{ (x+5)^{75}(x-17)^4(x-19)^{15}(x-22), \quad (x+5)^{75}(x-14)(x-19)^{19} \}
        \]
        together with the six polynomials listed in Table~\ref{tab:6polydim20}.
        (Running time: 0.61 seconds.)
        
        \item $P_{29,14}$ consists of the elements of 
        
        \[
            E_{29,14} = \left \{ \begin{array}{l}
                (x+5)^{15}(x-5)^{10}(x-7)^2(x^2-11x+16), \\
                (x+5)^{15}(x-3)(x-5)^9(x-7)^2(x^2-13x+32), \\
                (x+5)^{15}(x-5)^{10}(x-7)(x^3-18x^2+93x-128), \\
