codex
The paper’s native computational witnesses are not coordinates: Sections 4–6 use coefficient vectors of interlacing polynomials and exact Farkas certificates. The headline line configurations are only cited as previously known, with no coordinate construction in this paper. I’m checking the authors’ accompanying computation now to see whether its costly 450.77-second case admits a compact transformed-certificate family; otherwise the correct outcome is rejection, not a graph surrogate.
