The named `hard` rung is also being solved. This means the intended invariant is too conspicuous in the bare statement, not that the polynomial task lacks a mechanical/compact gap. I’m letting the mandated ladder finish untouched; any post-verdict decision will be based on the recorded replies and the harness’s own escalation budget.
